; The unit suites, one directory. Every domain's suite is a test stanza here
; and the fixture libraries live under fixtures/<suite>/, so a suite reaches
; another's fixtures by naming them, never by climbing out of the tree. The
; cram suites stay where their sandboxes are (test/cli, test/rules).

; The suite loads the fixture libraries' real build artifacts: the deps below
; name the cmt/cmti files and the sources the witness digests, including the
; built preprocessed file of the fix_pp fixture.

(test
 (name test_unit)
 (modules test_unit)
 (libraries windtrap litany compiler-libs.common)
