; The engine IO-purity freeze (the namespace-discipline pattern): runtest
; asserts by grep that no engine-side module in lib/ performs ambient IO —
; the driver and its named edges own every effect, and only the two
; demand-gated substrate readers (the unit loader, identifier resolution)
; read the filesystem, read-only. The catalog under lib/rules/ has its own
; discipline check beside its own suite.

(rule
 (aliases runtest io-purity)
 (deps
  (:script io_purity.sh)
  (:srcs
   (glob_files ../../lib/*.ml)))
 (action
  (run sh %{script} %{srcs})))

